/godotengine/godot/issues/110536","id":3299158806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EpSsW","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T14:56:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T14:56:37Z","body":"So the outputs mean that there's some board in your pc that controls the power button and fans ( https://github.com/system76/thelio-io-hardware , Googling brought me to this link), so it's basically a device gets recognized as a joystick even though it shouldn't. It should be an easy fix.\nThank you for testing!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299158806/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299239710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110536#issuecomment-3299239710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110536","id":3299239710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Epmce","user